> User Itsnicoleb (285322)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":345,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1906890,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283718,"Name":"SparkyM","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283718.png?_r=1446004687","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1446008539,"LastPoster":{"Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1906890,"PostDate":1446008539,"PostContent":"I'm a newbie to this forum and have never 'blogged' before (is that even what this is called?!?)...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeffandshauna2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435400211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283718.png?_r=1446004687","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SparkyM","Id":283718,"Name":"SparkyM","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ff45b5683d3e739e3419ed293831b6e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m a newbie to this forum and have never &#039;blogged&#039; before (is that even what this is called?!?)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyway, we&#039;re excited to be getting married in April 2016 at Ocean Coral &amp;amp; Turquesa in Riviera Maya! &amp;nbsp;And of course, would like as much info as possible to help guide the way! &amp;nbsp;Any info from former brides, grooms, guests, etc. at the OC&amp;amp;T is warmly welcomed &amp;amp; much appreciated!!    :rolleyes:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Specific current questions are:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;* Anyone have a travel agent who you love who does\/did a great job booking 30-50 rooms at this resort? At a competitive rate? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;* Several of our guests are bringing babies &amp;amp; young children. &amp;nbsp;Any words of wisdom on childcare and how to go about managing having nannies? Possibly from off property? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;* Still deciding on whether or not to bring our own photographers &amp;amp; videographer. &amp;nbsp;Definitely want to do a trash the dress session &amp;nbsp;the week after the wedding. &amp;nbsp;Any recommendations?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;* Anyone brought your own decorations, decor to this resort? &amp;nbsp;Did you bring it on the plane or have it sent ahead? &amp;nbsp;What would you recommend? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any thoughts, tips, tricks on ANY of these questions (or other info you think is important) will be received with MUCH GRATITUDE &amp;lt;3! &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Thanks so much ~ &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906890,"PostDate":1446008539,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm a newbie to this forum and have never 'blogged' before (is that even what this is called?!?)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyway, we're excited to be getting married in April 2016 at Ocean Coral & Turquesa in Riviera Maya! \u00a0And of course, would like as much info as possible to help guide the way! \u00a0Any info from former brides, grooms, guests, etc. at the OC&T is warmly welcomed & much appreciated!! \u00a0\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/rolleyes.gif' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':rolleyes:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Specific current questions are:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>* Anyone have a travel agent who you love who does\/did a great job booking 30-50 rooms at this resort? At a competitive rate? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>* Several of our guests are bringing babies & young children. \u00a0Any words of wisdom on childcare and how to go about managing having nannies? Possibly from off property? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>* Still deciding on whether or not to bring our own photographers & videographer. \u00a0Definitely want to do a trash the dress session \u00a0the week after the wedding. \u00a0Any recommendations?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>* Anyone brought your own decorations, decor to this resort? \u00a0Did you bring it on the plane or have it sent ahead? \u00a0What would you recommend? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any thoughts, tips, tricks on ANY of these questions (or other info you think is important) will be received with MUCH GRATITUDE <3! \u00a0 \u00a0Thanks so much ~ \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeffandshauna2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435400211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283718.png?_r=1446004687","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SparkyM","Id":283718,"Name":"SparkyM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"144.9.56.131","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d785b1c06838a8975e223afe4c862bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am getting married in July 2016 and I am working with a travel agent that I love. and she works for Wright travel. Which is&amp;nbsp;with this website.&amp;nbsp;Barbara is really good and helpful. You might want to check them out. I&#039;m glad I did. And&amp;nbsp;with childcare I have not had to deal with it since mine are teenagers but I have seen people bring small children and there own nannie with them. Some resorts make you pay for people who are not staying there pay a few to be there for the day. And not know the people at first hand I think it would be hard to leave my child with. I think&amp;nbsp;your guest should think about bringing someone they know and the kids know&amp;nbsp;will make everyone&amp;nbsp;feel better. As for the Photographers I am brining my own but I&amp;nbsp;have seen photos from&amp;nbsp;the resorts of there own photographers they make great photos but can be very costly so that depends on how much you want to spend on photos. As for decorations I&amp;nbsp;had a friend who got married in Mexico this year and she brought her own and carried them on the plane but you have to remember&amp;nbsp;the baggage policies of the airline and how many you can carrie on and check. I hope this helps.\t  &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906898,"PostDate":1446032931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting married in July 2016 and I am working with a travel agent that I love. and she works for Wright travel. Which is\u00a0with this website.\u00a0Barbara is really good and helpful. You might want to check them out. I'm glad I did. And\u00a0with childcare I have not had to deal with it since mine are teenagers but I have seen people bring small children and there own nannie with them. Some resorts make you pay for people who are not staying there pay a few to be there for the day. And not know the people at first hand I think it would be hard to leave my child with. I think\u00a0your guest should think about bringing someone they know and the kids know\u00a0will make everyone\u00a0feel better. As for the Photographers I am brining my own but I\u00a0have seen photos from\u00a0the resorts of there own photographers they make great photos but can be very costly so that depends on how much you want to spend on photos. As for decorations I\u00a0had a friend who got married in Mexico this year and she brought her own and carried them on the plane but you have to remember\u00a0the baggage policies of the airline and how many you can carrie on and check. I hope this helps.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440294410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.176.231.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cfe5da771b393d7a431d077c09cc71a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello SarklyM !&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m also using Barbara (Babs) at Wright Travel. She&#039;s amazing. I&#039;ve heard a lot of complaints from Brides that do not&amp;nbsp; receive response to email and calls, but Babs is always super prompt with my inquiries as well as my guests. She&#039;s also super sweet! Really glad to have found her.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We chose the Occidental Grand Xcaret for our wedding after going on vacation and becoming engaged&amp;nbsp; there last year. We fell in love with it.They offer a kids club with loads of activities for the littles. Also, it&#039;s next to two ecological parks- Xcaret and Xplore which are both amazing expieriences. Our nieces and nephews will LOVE XCARET. We don&#039;t have anyone that has decided on using an outside nanny, so no advice there.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We haven&#039;t decided on a photographer yet. This is next on my list&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Decor...some wedding packages include some decor. I think it depends on the resort and package you choose. I&#039;m taking some additional decor to add a personalized feel on the plane with me. I&#039;ve heard horror stories of sending decor ahead...so I&#039;m not going that route. Also, I found a great lady named Katy who owns Love &amp;amp; Lace Wedding Decor on the&amp;nbsp; Cancun Brides and Riviera Maya Brides Facebook group, who rents some really amazing decor stuff for less than my resort. Her FB page Love &amp;amp; Lace Wedding Decor.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906909,"PostDate":1446052953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello SarklyM !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm also using Barbara (Babs) at Wright Travel. She's amazing. I've heard a lot of complaints from Brides that do not\u00a0 receive response to email and calls, but Babs is always super prompt with my inquiries as well as my guests. She's also super sweet! Really glad to have found her.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We chose the Occidental Grand Xcaret for our wedding after going on vacation and becoming engaged\u00a0 there last year. We fell in love with it.They offer a kids club with loads of activities for the littles. Also, it's next to two ecological parks- Xcaret and Xplore which are both amazing expieriences. Our nieces and nephews will LOVE XCARET. We don't have anyone that has decided on using an outside nanny, so no advice there.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We haven't decided on a photographer yet. This is next on my list<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Decor...some wedding packages include some decor. I think it depends on the resort and package you choose. I'm taking some additional decor to add a personalized feel on the plane with me. I've heard horror stories of sending decor ahead...so I'm not going that route. Also, I found a great lady named Katy who owns Love & Lace Wedding Decor on the\u00a0 Cancun Brides and Riviera Maya Brides Facebook group, who rents some really amazing decor stuff for less than my resort. Her FB page Love & Lace Wedding Decor.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christierwayne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.211.64.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421198600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281717.jpg?_r=1447373783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Christie77","Id":281717,"Name":"Christie77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.166.34.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3824070e461f1814a78105820918f3cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community and COngrats on your upcoming dw in our magnificent Mayan Riviera, SparkyM!!! You&#039;ve come to the right place for lots of great info, advice, suggerstions and support from everyone here, so you&#039;re off to a wonderful start already - good job :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ve also picked a beautifully picturesque wedding venue in the Ocean Coral &amp;amp; Turquesa - as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there......taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151623737984487.1073741852.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Ocean Coral &amp;amp; Turquesa Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/981500_10151623740094487_1353524966_o.jpg\" alt=\"981500_10151623740094487_1353524966_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/1015769_10151623740144487_649434186_o.jpg\" alt=\"1015769_10151623740144487_649434186_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1008506_10151623741264487_29556171_o.jpg\" alt=\"1008506_10151623741264487_29556171_o.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/1015048_10151623742969487_798807276_o.jpg\" alt=\"1015048_10151623742969487_798807276_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/1005068_10151623743369487_149111898_n.jpg?oh=63c6c831e3a8d5633c950bfafef4e19d&amp;amp;oe=56B5BDE6\" alt=\"1005068_10151623743369487_149111898_n.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research ~ ENjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906910,"PostDate":1446053218,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community and COngrats on your upcoming dw in our magnificent Mayan Riviera, SparkyM!!! You've come to the right place for lots of great info, advice, suggerstions and support from everyone here, so you're off to a wonderful start already - good job <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've also picked a beautifully picturesque wedding venue in the Ocean Coral & Turquesa - as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there......taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151623737984487.1073741852.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Ocean Coral & Turquesa Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/981500_10151623740094487_1353524966_o.jpg\" alt=\"981500_10151623740094487_1353524966_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/1015769_10151623740144487_649434186_o.jpg\" alt=\"1015769_10151623740144487_649434186_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1008506_10151623741264487_29556171_o.jpg\" alt=\"1008506_10151623741264487_29556171_o.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/1015048_10151623742969487_798807276_o.jpg\" alt=\"1015048_10151623742969487_798807276_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/1005068_10151623743369487_149111898_n.jpg?oh=63c6c831e3a8d5633c950bfafef4e19d&oe=56B5BDE6\" alt=\"1005068_10151623743369487_149111898_n.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research ~ ENjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71811112626a47feb600fe93966fc857","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lorishultz2016\" post=\"1906898\" timestamp=\"1446032931\"]\nI am getting married in July 2016 and I am working with a travel agent that I love. and she works for Wright travel. Which is with this website. Barbara is really good and helpful. You might want to check them out. I&#039;m glad I did. And with childcare I have not had to deal with it since mine are teenagers but I have seen people bring small children and there own nannie with them. Some resorts make you pay for people who are not staying there pay a few to be there for the day. And not know the people at first hand I think it would be hard to leave my child with. I think your guest should think about bringing someone they know and the kids know will make everyone feel better. As for the Photographers I am brining my own but I have seen photos from the resorts of there own photographers they make great photos but can be very costly so that depends on how much you want to spend on photos. As for decorations I had a friend who got married in Mexico this year and she brought her own and carried them on the plane but you have to remember the baggage policies of the airline and how many you can carrie on and check. I hope this helps.[\/quote]CONGRATS!!!  I&#039;ll be sure to loop you in on what I learn after ours :-)  And yes, you&#039;re comments are Super Helpful!  Thank you!!   Is Wright travel located in the US? \n[quote name=\"Christie77\" post=\"1906909\" timestamp=\"1446052953\"]\nHello SarklyM !\n\nI&#039;m also using Barbara (Babs) at Wright Travel. She&#039;s amazing. I&#039;ve heard a lot of complaints from Brides that do not  receive response to email and calls, but Babs is always super prompt with my inquiries as well as my guests. She&#039;s also super sweet! Really glad to have found her.\n\nWe chose the Occidental Grand Xcaret for our wedding after going on vacation and becoming engaged  there last year. We fell in love with it.They offer a kids club with loads of activities for the littles. Also, it&#039;s next to two ecological parks- Xcaret and Xplore which are both amazing expieriences. Our nieces and nephews will LOVE XCARET. We don&#039;t have anyone that has decided on using an outside nanny, so no advice there.\n\nWe haven&#039;t decided on a photographer yet. This is next on my list\n\nDecor...some wedding packages include some decor. I think it depends on the resort and package you choose. I&#039;m taking some additional decor to add a personalized feel on the plane with me. I&#039;ve heard horror stories of sending decor ahead...so I&#039;m not going that route. Also, I found a great lady named Katy who owns Love &amp;amp; Lace Wedding Decor on the  Cancun Brides and Riviera Maya Brides Facebook group, who rents some really amazing decor stuff for less than my resort. Her FB page Love &amp;amp; Lace Wedding Decor.\n\n\nHappy planning!![\/quote]\nBrilliant @[member=\"Christie77\"]!  Thank You!  Love the lead on \"Babs\" and the Facebook Groups.  You Rock!  \n\nOccidental is one of the places we&#039;re thinking of honeymooning  (changing hotels after the wedding and staying an extra week).  Would love to hear more about it. \n\nAnd CONGRATS!  When&#039;s you&#039;re date?","Attachments":[],"Id":1906961,"PostDate":1446195908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lorishultz2016, on 28 October 2015 - 03:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am getting married in July 2016 and I am working with a travel agent that I love. and she works for Wright travel. Which is\u00a0with this website.\u00a0Barbara is really good and helpful. You might want to check them out. I'm glad I did. And\u00a0with childcare I have not had to deal with it since mine are teenagers but I have seen people bring small children and there own nannie with them. Some resorts make you pay for people who are not staying there pay a few to be there for the day. And not know the people at first hand I think it would be hard to leave my child with. I think\u00a0your guest should think about bringing someone they know and the kids know\u00a0will make everyone\u00a0feel better. As for the Photographers I am brining my own but I\u00a0have seen photos from\u00a0the resorts of there own photographers they make great photos but can be very costly so that depends on how much you want to spend on photos. As for decorations I\u00a0had a friend who got married in Mexico this year and she brought her own and carried them on the plane but you have to remember\u00a0the baggage policies of the airline and how many you can carrie on and check. I hope this helps.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>CONGRATS!!! \u00a0I'll be sure to loop you in on what I learn after ours :-) \u00a0And yes, you're comments are Super Helpful! \u00a0Thank you!! \u00a0 Is Wright travel located in the US?\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Christie77, on 28 October 2015 - 09:22 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello SarklyM !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm also using Barbara (Babs) at Wright Travel. She's amazing. I've heard a lot of complaints from Brides that do not\u00a0 receive response to email and calls, but Babs is always super prompt with my inquiries as well as my guests. She's also super sweet! Really glad to have found her.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We chose the Occidental Grand Xcaret for our wedding after going on vacation and becoming engaged\u00a0 there last year. We fell in love with it.They offer a kids club with loads of activities for the littles. Also, it's next to two ecological parks- Xcaret and Xplore which are both amazing expieriences. Our nieces and nephews will LOVE XCARET. We don't have anyone that has decided on using an outside nanny, so no advice there.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We haven't decided on a photographer yet. This is next on my list<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Decor...some wedding packages include some decor. I think it depends on the resort and package you choose. I'm taking some additional decor to add a personalized feel on the plane with me. I've heard horror stories of sending decor ahead...so I'm not going that route. Also, I found a great lady named Katy who owns Love & Lace Wedding Decor on the\u00a0 Cancun Brides and Riviera Maya Brides Facebook group, who rents some really amazing decor stuff for less than my resort. Her FB page Love & Lace Wedding Decor.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Brilliant @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281717\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281717-christie77\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Christie77<\/span><\/a>! \u00a0Thank You! \u00a0Love the lead on \"Babs\" and the Facebook Groups. \u00a0You Rock! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Occidental is one of the places we're thinking of honeymooning \u00a0(changing hotels after the wedding and staying an extra week). \u00a0Would love to hear more about it.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And CONGRATS! \u00a0When's you're date? \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeffandshauna2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435400211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283718.png?_r=1446004687","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SparkyM","Id":283718,"Name":"SparkyM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.176.231.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdd8cef8dcddafddd1c9ae8d26706a26","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Our date is May 14th :D&amp;nbsp; We will be married at the ruins (pics below) If looking at the wedding set up pic, the ruins are set to the right. Reception at the beach club (also pic below). The place is HUGE!! There are 11 restaurants, 10 bars, multiple pools. Adults only area, but kid friendly areas as well. A different show every night. We loved it last time.&amp;nbsp; If you&#039;re a Costco member, it&#039;s totally worth checking out pricing there. That&#039;s how we booked last time and it saved us tons of money. We didn&#039;t book that way for the wedding as I wanted a travel agent to organize the trip and field questions, but if it&#039;s just you two you&#039;ll save big time going through them. Google Costco travel and you can check pricing that way. It includes flight and all inclusive stay.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me know, what questions you have and I&#039;d be happy to answer if I can.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img height=\"354\" src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/u\/0\/?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=622a5be9cd&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=150b5b90a6074df8&amp;amp;attid=0.4&amp;amp;disp=emb&amp;amp;realattid=ii_150a67bdb336e549&amp;amp;attbid=ANGjdJ-w0t4zklhgGRTg7772QCprfkEt0ndQA_TlEdUAXM-5g3gTo8qKr0AkCqlyqpqfl14HroKVnX9aft9Sa0sQIcvA5pbWm7uBVJA7GKpgDZK6EJ8FaChGRMPIkn0&amp;amp;sz=s0-l75&amp;amp;ats=1446218357934&amp;amp;rm=150b5b90a6074df8&amp;amp;zw\" width=\"530\" alt=\"?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=622a5be9cd&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=150b5b9\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img height=\"411\" src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/w2-GhsfewyIZfsXDJ4mu4HGpGw45Y19MFuOLkVx0kpjpzIpYwaqocEyyyIpbp26w1qhCVgVpt6bEqUK9DzA7KIWawCeZinEgTZRuBexAqE3ODcPhdrrsBh-gmtrAd59QdbtbBNoGpq-JD9PlKmrcrKVQSv-ndp4DA3oOrPDvUxhvt7wEgNp0sa76_SECv7gz=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/www.myhotelwedding.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Occidental-Grand-Xcaret_FineArt-Studio-Photography02202015039.jpg\" width=\"617\" alt=\"Occidental-Grand-Xcaret_FineArt-Studio-P\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906967,"PostDate":1446219362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Our date is May 14th <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 We will be married at the ruins (pics below) If looking at the wedding set up pic, the ruins are set to the right. Reception at the beach club (also pic below). The place is HUGE!! There are 11 restaurants, 10 bars, multiple pools. Adults only area, but kid friendly areas as well. A different show every night. We loved it last time.\u00a0 If you're a Costco member, it's totally worth checking out pricing there. That's how we booked last time and it saved us tons of money. We didn't book that way for the wedding as I wanted a travel agent to organize the trip and field questions, but if it's just you two you'll save big time going through them. Google Costco travel and you can check pricing that way. It includes flight and all inclusive stay.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know, what questions you have and I'd be happy to answer if I can.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"354\" src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/u\/0\/?ui=2&ik=622a5be9cd&view=fimg&th=150b5b90a6074df8&attid=0.4&disp=emb&realattid=ii_150a67bdb336e549&attbid=ANGjdJ-w0t4zklhgGRTg7772QCprfkEt0ndQA_TlEdUAXM-5g3gTo8qKr0AkCqlyqpqfl14HroKVnX9aft9Sa0sQIcvA5pbWm7uBVJA7GKpgDZK6EJ8FaChGRMPIkn0&sz=s0-l75&ats=1446218357934&rm=150b5b90a6074df8&zw\" width=\"530\" alt=\"?ui=2&ik=622a5be9cd&view=fimg&th=150b5b9\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"411\" src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/w2-GhsfewyIZfsXDJ4mu4HGpGw45Y19MFuOLkVx0kpjpzIpYwaqocEyyyIpbp26w1qhCVgVpt6bEqUK9DzA7KIWawCeZinEgTZRuBexAqE3ODcPhdrrsBh-gmtrAd59QdbtbBNoGpq-JD9PlKmrcrKVQSv-ndp4DA3oOrPDvUxhvt7wEgNp0sa76_SECv7gz=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/www.myhotelwedding.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Occidental-Grand-Xcaret_FineArt-Studio-Photography02202015039.jpg\" width=\"617\" alt=\"Occidental-Grand-Xcaret_FineArt-Studio-P\"><\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christierwayne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.211.64.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421198600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281717.jpg?_r=1447373783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Christie77","Id":281717,"Name":"Christie77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d102cc4dabc3d9543690467486f5d24","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lorishultz2016\" post=\"1906898\" timestamp=\"1446032931\"]\nI am getting married in July 2016 and I am working with a travel agent that I love. and she works for Wright travel. Which is with this website. Barbara is really good and helpful. You might want to check them out. I&#039;m glad I did. And with childcare I have not had to deal with it since mine are teenagers but I have seen people bring small children and there own nannie with them. Some resorts make you pay for people who are not staying there pay a few to be there for the day. And not know the people at first hand I think it would be hard to leave my child with. I think your guest should think about bringing someone they know and the kids know will make everyone feel better. As for the Photographers I am brining my own but I have seen photos from the resorts of there own photographers they make great photos but can be very costly so that depends on how much you want to spend on photos. As for decorations I had a friend who got married in Mexico this year and she brought her own and carried them on the plane but you have to remember the baggage policies of the airline and how many you can carrie on and check. I hope this helps.[\/quote]Thank you so much for your response :-)  I&#039;m having a small panic attack because the rooms for our wedding week have suddenly disappeared off ALL discount websites :unsure:  We&#039;ve got approx 6 rooms already booked and need to book about 40 more!!  It sounds like Barbara may have a strong connection with the hotel &amp;amp; distributors; I&#039;ll reach out to her.  Do you happen to know what time zone she&#039;s in?   Again, thank you so much for your response... gonna keep on breathing and keeping the faith.... #IthoughtDestinationWeddingsweresupposedtoBeLessStressful  :( LOL!   \n[quote name=\"Christie77\" post=\"1906967\" timestamp=\"1446219362\"]\nOur date is May 14th :D  We will be married at the ruins (pics below) If looking at the wedding set up pic, the ruins are set to the right. Reception at the beach club (also pic below). The place is HUGE!! There are 11 restaurants, 10 bars, multiple pools. Adults only area, but kid friendly areas as well. A different show every night. We loved it last time.  If you&#039;re a Costco member, it&#039;s totally worth checking out pricing there. That&#039;s how we booked last time and it saved us tons of money. We didn&#039;t book that way for the wedding as I wanted a travel agent to organize the trip and field questions, but if it&#039;s just you two you&#039;ll save big time going through them. Google Costco travel and you can check pricing that way. It includes flight and all inclusive stay. \n\nLet me know, what questions you have and I&#039;d be happy to answer if I can.\n\n\n[img]https&#58;\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/u\/0\/?ui=2&amp;amp;ik=622a5be9cd&amp;amp;view=fimg&amp;amp;th=150b5b90a6074df8&amp;amp;attid=0.4&amp;amp;disp=emb&amp;amp;realattid=ii_150a67bdb336e549&amp;amp;attbid=ANGjdJ-w0t4zklhgGRTg7772QCprfkEt0ndQA_TlEdUAXM-5g3gTo8qKr0AkCqlyqpqfl14HroKVnX9aft9Sa0sQIcvA5pbWm7uBVJA7GKpgDZK6EJ8FaChGRMPIkn0&amp;amp;sz=s0-l75&amp;amp;ats=1446218357934&amp;amp;rm=150b5b90a6074df8&amp;amp;zw[\/img]\n\n[img]https&#58;\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/w2-GhsfewyIZfsXDJ4mu4HGpGw45Y19MFuOLkVx0kpjpzIpYwaqocEyyyIpbp26w1qhCVgVpt6bEqUK9DzA7KIWawCeZinEgTZRuBexAqE3ODcPhdrrsBh-gmtrAd59QdbtbBNoGpq-JD9PlKmrcrKVQSv-ndp4DA3oOrPDvUxhvt7wEgNp0sa76_SECv7gz=s0-d-e1-ft#http&#58;\/\/www.myhotelwedding.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Occidental-Grand-Xcaret_FineArt-Studio-Photography02202015039.jpg[\/img][\/quote]Thanks so much for the costco tip @[member=\"Christie77\"] !  Great idea :-)  I love how generous you and all the other amazing brides on this site are with sharing their golden information!  So helpful &amp;lt;3  Thank you!  I promise to pay it forward to other brides-to-be  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1907051,"PostDate":1446498394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lorishultz2016, on 28 October 2015 - 03:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am getting married in July 2016 and I am working with a travel agent that I love. and she works for Wright travel. Which is\u00a0with this website.\u00a0Barbara is really good and helpful. You might want to check them out. I'm glad I did. And\u00a0with childcare I have not had to deal with it since mine are teenagers but I have seen people bring small children and there own nannie with them. Some resorts make you pay for people who are not staying there pay a few to be there for the day. And not know the people at first hand I think it would be hard to leave my child with. I think\u00a0your guest should think about bringing someone they know and the kids know\u00a0will make everyone\u00a0feel better. As for the Photographers I am brining my own but I\u00a0have seen photos from\u00a0the resorts of there own photographers they make great photos but can be very costly so that depends on how much you want to spend on photos. As for decorations I\u00a0had a friend who got married in Mexico this year and she brought her own and carried them on the plane but you have to remember\u00a0the baggage policies of the airline and how many you can carrie on and check. I hope this helps.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you so much for your response :-) \u00a0I'm having a small panic attack because the rooms for our wedding week have suddenly disappeared off ALL discount websites <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/>\u00a0\u00a0We've got approx 6 rooms already booked and need to book about 40 more!! \u00a0It sounds like Barbara may have a strong connection with the hotel & distributors; I'll reach out to her. \u00a0Do you happen to know what time zone she's in? \u00a0 Again, thank you so much for your response... gonna keep on breathing and keeping the faith.... #IthoughtDestinationWeddingsweresupposedtoBeLessStressful\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\u00a0LOL! \u00a0\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Christie77, on 30 October 2015 - 07:36 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Our date is May 14th <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 We will be married at the ruins (pics below) If looking at the wedding set up pic, the ruins are set to the right. Reception at the beach club (also pic below). The place is HUGE!! There are 11 restaurants, 10 bars, multiple pools. Adults only area, but kid friendly areas as well. A different show every night. We loved it last time.\u00a0 If you're a Costco member, it's totally worth checking out pricing there. That's how we booked last time and it saved us tons of money. We didn't book that way for the wedding as I wanted a travel agent to organize the trip and field questions, but if it's just you two you'll save big time going through them. Google Costco travel and you can check pricing that way. It includes flight and all inclusive stay.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know, what questions you have and I'd be happy to answer if I can.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"354\" src=\"https:\/\/mail.google.com\/mail\/u\/0\/?ui=2&ik=622a5be9cd&view=fimg&th=150b5b90a6074df8&attid=0.4&disp=emb&realattid=ii_150a67bdb336e549&attbid=ANGjdJ-w0t4zklhgGRTg7772QCprfkEt0ndQA_TlEdUAXM-5g3gTo8qKr0AkCqlyqpqfl14HroKVnX9aft9Sa0sQIcvA5pbWm7uBVJA7GKpgDZK6EJ8FaChGRMPIkn0&sz=s0-l75&ats=1446218357934&rm=150b5b90a6074df8&zw\" width=\"530\" alt=\"?ui=2&ik=622a5be9cd&view=fimg&th=150b5b9\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"411\" src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/w2-GhsfewyIZfsXDJ4mu4HGpGw45Y19MFuOLkVx0kpjpzIpYwaqocEyyyIpbp26w1qhCVgVpt6bEqUK9DzA7KIWawCeZinEgTZRuBexAqE3ODcPhdrrsBh-gmtrAd59QdbtbBNoGpq-JD9PlKmrcrKVQSv-ndp4DA3oOrPDvUxhvt7wEgNp0sa76_SECv7gz=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/www.myhotelwedding.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Occidental-Grand-Xcaret_FineArt-Studio-Photography02202015039.jpg\" width=\"617\" alt=\"Occidental-Grand-Xcaret_FineArt-Studio-P\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks so much for the costco tip @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281717\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281717-christie77\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Christie77<\/span><\/a> ! \u00a0Great idea :-) \u00a0I love how generous you and all the other amazing brides on this site are with sharing their golden information! \u00a0So helpful <3 \u00a0Thank you! \u00a0I promise to pay it forward to other brides-to-be\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeffandshauna2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.67.60.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435400211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283718.png?_r=1446004687","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SparkyM","Id":283718,"Name":"SparkyM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.80.187.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c654d24d0f47d3a4d7578818f834e12e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sounds wonderful, SparkyM!!! that&#039;s what makes this forum community so great :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also wanted to give you a \"heads-up\" on bringing a photographer or videographer from home... that it is illegal for a photographer to come to Mexico and photograph a wedding without proper working papers. The same way people can not just travel to the USA or Canada and work. Cancun airport is aware of this and as you will see... scans all luggage arriving when you go through customs. People traveling with more than one camera will need to answer for the equipment. Im not trying to scare you... just give you the facts of working in a foreign country.\n\nMTM has recently changed all the prices to accommodate couples who are working with a budget. We now offer a 50% discount on resort vendor fees! :-)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s what our premier photographer, Lincoln tells our wedding couples....&lt;em&gt;\"You may also be considering going with the resort photography team... often to save money. My only suggestion to you is that if photography is important to you at all... please find a professional photographer to come and capture your day.&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;A true professional photographer is not just an employee of a large company that works at a resort shooting weddings. Our job is our passion and we work to not only capture YOUR story but bring out the emotions and your personality in the day. Every wedding is unique and not just a 9 to 5 job which resort photographers shoot.&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The reason I say this... is I was recently at a wedding where the resort photographer and I over lapped for 30 minutes during the reception. I later heard back from the bride who sent me her photos from the resort photographer and was shocked at how they came out and were delivered. I too was shocked at the quality and made a small FaceBook album comparing the different between what you tend to get using resort photography vs a real photographer.&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here is a link to my post showing the difference. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152644932899487.1073741911.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Professional Photography vs Resort Photography.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adding to that, here is another example where you can view the difference between Professional photography vs Resort photography.&amp;nbsp; There are not a lot of direct examples of this wedding as the resort photographer didn&#039;t capture anything we did!&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Resort photos are blurry, dull, lifeless and a complete waste of your time and money!\u200b&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1401840_10152644935819487_7696704350220352843_o.jpg\" alt=\"1401840_10152644935819487_76967043502203\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10476353_10152644937229487_8556873023491212854_o.jpg\" alt=\"10476353_10152644937229487_8556873023491\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All that being said... I wish you the best of luck with whatever you decide.\"&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope it all works out just the way you envision&amp;nbsp; - or even Better....Cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907074,"PostDate":1446560790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sounds wonderful, SparkyM!!! that's what makes this forum community so great <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also wanted to give you a \"heads-up\" on bringing a photographer or videographer from home... that it is illegal for a photographer to come to Mexico and photograph a wedding without proper working papers. The same way people can not just travel to the USA or Canada and work. Cancun airport is aware of this and as you will see... scans all luggage arriving when you go through customs. People traveling with more than one camera will need to answer for the equipment. Im not trying to scare you... just give you the facts of working in a foreign country.<br>\nMTM has recently changed all the prices to accommodate couples who are working with a budget. We now offer a 50% discount on resort vendor fees! :-)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's what our premier photographer, Lincoln tells our wedding couples....<em>\"You may also be considering going with the resort photography team... often to save money. My only suggestion to you is that if photography is important to you at all... please find a professional photographer to come and capture your day.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>A true professional photographer is not just an employee of a large company that works at a resort shooting weddings. Our job is our passion and we work to not only capture YOUR story but bring out the emotions and your personality in the day. Every wedding is unique and not just a 9 to 5 job which resort photographers shoot.<\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><em>The reason I say this... is I was recently at a wedding where the resort photographer and I over lapped for 30 minutes during the reception. I later heard back from the bride who sent me her photos from the resort photographer and was shocked at how they came out and were delivered. I too was shocked at the quality and made a small FaceBook album comparing the different between what you tend to get using resort photography vs a real photographer.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>Here is a link to my post showing the difference. <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152644932899487.1073741911.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Professional Photography vs Resort Photography.<\/a><\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>Adding to that, here is another example where you can view the difference between Professional photography vs Resort photography.\u00a0 There are not a lot of direct examples of this wedding as the resort photographer didn't capture anything we did!<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>Resort photos are blurry, dull, lifeless and a complete waste of your time and money!\u200b<\/em><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1401840_10152644935819487_7696704350220352843_o.jpg\" alt=\"1401840_10152644935819487_76967043502203\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10476353_10152644937229487_8556873023491212854_o.jpg\" alt=\"10476353_10152644937229487_8556873023491\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><em>All that being said... I wish you the best of luck with whatever you decide.\"<\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope it all works out just the way you envision\u00a0 - or even Better....Cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"144.9.40.131","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79688,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5958cc43ccda3e0f6f1264e172d8bc30","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;She is on the&amp;nbsp;west cost in Calf. And&amp;nbsp;I hope she can help you. I know she&amp;nbsp;was great. But i would book soon.&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;lori\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907315,"PostDate":1447161622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u>She is on the\u00a0west cost in Calf. And\u00a0I hope she can help you. I know she\u00a0was great. But i would book soon.<\/u><\/p>\n<p><u>lori\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/u><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440294410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79688","Title":"Ocean Coral & Turquesa Wedding-April 2016! Vendor, Misc Hotel Question","LastPostDate":1447161622},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
